        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK70x-bJePS8RiH0bmUVEQ2UskcbLr67oa-WNCUAJUrrXvapQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "From the first phone call to Dolores to the on-site visit from Mike, the entire experience was fantastic. Everyone was very professional, knowledgeable, and genuinely kind. The crew that came out to install our new fence was absolutely amazing — they worked efficiently, paid great attention to detail, and clearly took pride in their work. The finished product is beautiful, and our pups are in heaven with their new space! We’re so grateful for the excellent service and would highly recommend this team to anyone looking for quality work and a great experience from start to finish.\nThanks so very much\nRoss & Dawn",
        "time": 1757434410,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Robert Fania",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101424452576055372639/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMCFiClDShH8i2oA-DVi_I3tPiCxUgU3xo-F9QdkHiEDqKSw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "From our first interaction we had a great experience. Mike was responsive and attentive to our needs from a presales perspective. Alain and his team of installers did a phenomenal job. They constantly checked with us during the process to ensure we were happy with the placement of our fence. After each step they cleaned up and left no dirt or mess. I would highly recommend Clotures Raymond. Thank you Mike, Alain and team.",
        "time": 1687533302,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Francois Castonguay",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118168585800967994554/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJpi6E8plKS4QwF-3ZukcJSuPpT-HU6PzNC8lzd6GimtLvaUw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Mike and his team made sure the product and the install was 1st class, they showed up on time were very polite did an impeccable job …btw the left the place cleaner than before",
        "time": 1751747899,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
